[
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/trees/fu_engineering",
    "value": "Engineering"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/default/0",
    "value": "Instructions"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/default/1",
    "value": "Select a research by clicking one of the icons on the grid.\nYou can navigate the grid by dragging with the left mouse button.\n\n- The left most button at the upper part of the screen opens a list of research trees to pick from.\n\n- The second button opens a list of non-hidden research options. Click a research on the displayed to center the view on it. Click again to hide the list.\n\n- The third button will center the view on the middle of the tree, or the currently selected research.\n\n- The last button toggles ^orange;low quality mode^reset;. This makes the GUI jump to a position instead of panning to it, or the center button. In addition, dragging/navigating on the the main screen will update only after you release the mouse button. It is best to use the search list with this mode enabled."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/0",
    "value": "Basic Training"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYour training, thanks to four years in the Protectorate Academy, provides you with basic survival skills to keep you alive for extended periods in the event of a crash."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/engineering/0",
    "value": "Machining"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/engineering/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nThe ^orange;Machining Table^reset; is the place to produce mechanical components, and will serve as the base workstation for many of your scientific forays. You've learned to create one yourself along with variety of basic items used in engineering.\n\nTo craft a ^orange;Machining Table^reset; you'll need to use your basic ^green;[C]rafting^reset; menu."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/goldcircuitry/0",
    "value": "Gold Circuits"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/goldcircuitry/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nGold has many useful applications in computing. You can now put it to use in the creation of useful processors and RAM sticks. Make sure to upgrade your Machining Table into an ^orange;Auto Assembler^reset; first!"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/shields/0",
    "value": "Shields"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/shields/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nWith a solid understanding of computer technology and physics you can now create Force Fields that ^green;protect your base from harm^reset;, ^green;control gravity^reset; and ^green;provide breathable air^reset;. Quite useful!\n\nTo protect a location, place two field markers at the opposite corners of a square around the area, and wire them to the field generator's output connector. Field extenders can be used as relays, to connect the field markers beyond the normal wiring range."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/graphenecircuitry/0",
    "value": "Graphene Circuits"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/graphenecircuitry/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nThe wonderful material known as Graphene conducts electricity far better than its carbon origins might indicate. With it, you can create very durable, heat resistant circuits that will be useful in heavy machinery."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/modulecrafting/0",
    "value": "Upgrade Crafting"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/modulecrafting/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nUsing your knowledge of microengineering, you can now fabricate your own upgrade modules, manipulator modules and tech cards at your Auto Assembler."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/protocitecircuitry/0",
    "value": "Protocite Circuits"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/protocitecircuitry/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've put the insane energy-transferring properties of Protocite to work in highly complex processors which work with quantum bits - no longer just 1 or 0, but sometimes both! Quantum Procesors have many uses in higher-end electronics."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/focusingarray/0",
    "value": "Focusing Arrays"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/focusingarray/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nBy combining quantum computing with specialized crystals, you can create energy-focusing devices that are excellent in high-tech machines as well as powerful energy weapons."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/microformer/0",
    "value": "Terraforming"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/microformer/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nThrough the combination of Ancient Essence and robust particle focusers, you can now alter a small part of a planet to better suit your desires using microformation devices."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/terraformer/0",
    "value": "Terraforming II"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/terraformer/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYou can now shape entire planets to your liking, altering their environment to new types. Note that this will not work for Ocean worlds, which is why no such terraformers exist."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/terraformer2/0",
    "value": "Terraforming III"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/terraformer2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nThanks to your understanding of terraforming devices you can now create even more interesting forms of worlds."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/morphitecircuitry/0",
    "value": "Morphite Circuits"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/morphitecircuitry/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nWith access to Morphite, even AI technology is within your reach, allowing the creation of supremely fast computing components that are capable of self-improvement and basic decision-making. It's no surprise that many governments ban this technology outright for fear of what amazing things it can do."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/powercores1/0",
    "value": "Energy Cores"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/powercores1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've designed a trio of powerful energy cores, each with their own laundry list of scientific and military applications. Molten Cores are excellent when dealing with intense heat such as in blast furnaces or lava-spewing flamethrowers. Power Cores shine in kinetic applications, and are useful in machines with many moving parts and high-end ballistic weaponry. Nuclear Cores are useful for channeling radiation, such as in a fission reactor, or just plain making tons of energy for high-demand inventions."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/powercores2/0",
    "value": "Improved Cores"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/powercores2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYour skill with compact power sources has allowed you to make two more useful cores, expanding your engineering capability greatly. Teleporter Cores are perfect for transportation and constructing large, automated item networks, while Particle Cores are unmatched at channeling atomic and subatomic particles - the photons in a powerful laser, for example."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/teleporters/0",
    "value": "DIY Teleportation"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/teleporters/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nNo longer do you need to pay a professional - you ^green;are^reset; that professional! You can make a variety of personal teleporters on your own."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers1/0",
    "value": "Research Computers"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've put your knowledge of computer parts to use to produce handy laptops that will automatically research items for you."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers2/0",
    "value": "Improved Researchers"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nAccess to quantum computing means you can make stronger computers that research more quickly and store more data."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers3/0",
    "value": "Neural Networks"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nWith AI technology, you've designed a data tower which will generate huge amounts of research for your benefit, vastly outstripping all computers that came before it."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers4/0",
    "value": "Superior Networks"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers4/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYour AI is super-advanced now, and generate huge amounts of research for your benefit, allowing you to kick off your shoes and finally let something do the work for you that you can rely on."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction1/0",
    "value": "Extraction Basics"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've learned the basics of resource extraction and can now build rudimentary devices to extract, research and centrifuge materials. \n\n^cyan;Extractor^reset;\n\nPut almost anything in and it will convert it into something else. Most items are processed in groups of 50. \n\n^cyan;Centrifuge^reset;\n\nPut any liquid inside and the centrifuge will start working - though the wooden one isn't quite durable enough to handle lava and other volatile stuff. Researched in the ^orange;Power Systems^reset; tree. \n\n^cyan;Research Computer^reset;\n\nPut an item with a value greater than 0 in one and it will automatically convert it into an amount of research equal to ^green;5% of the item's pixel value^reset;. Faster computers can be built by pursuing ^orange;Gold Circuits^reset; research."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction2/0",
    "value": "Extraction Labs"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nThe extraction lab is a big step up over the hand mill, working much more quickly. You'll want many extraction labs to process all sorts of resources."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction3/0",
    "value": "Advanced Extraction"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've greatly improved upon your extraction lab design, producing a lab that is faster than ever at processing resources and even gives some bonus outputs."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics1/0",
    "value": "Basic Robotics"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nWith your engineering knowledge, you have designed a few basic depolyable robot minions to help you out."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics2/0",
    "value": "Stronger Robots"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYour robotic knowledge is growing, and it shows in your handy new designs. You now have access to stronger robots."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics3/0",
    "value": "Murderbots"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou're a master at making combat drones. Your latest creations are deadlier than ever and will protect you quite nicely."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/tinkering1/0",
    "value": "Tinkering"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/tinkering1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou're learning that engineering isn't just about making new things, but improving on the ones you already made. To this end, you've learned to create a ^orange;Tinkering Table^reset; which will allow you to make EPP modules, mining gear, special weapon upgrades, and useful tools such as a Hookshot or Mining Laser."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmbasic/0",
    "value": "Basic EPP Modules"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmbasic/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've developed a suite of simple EPP modules which can be installed to gain useful benefits in addition to the effects your EPP already provides."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmadv/0",
    "value": "Improved Modules"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmadv/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've improved upon your EPP module design, developing upgrades for many of your modules and inventing a few new ones, too."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmres1/0",
    "value": "Defensive Modules"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmres1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've designed a lot of new EPP modules which will protect you from heat, radiation, cold and other hazards. Surviving hostile environments has never been so easy."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmres2/0",
    "value": "Advanced Protection"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmres2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYour defensive modules have gotten even better, allowing you to resist more exotic elements like Cosmic and Shadow and completely protect from hot, cold or radioactive planets."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmbest/0",
    "value": "Module Mastery"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmbest/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nWith mastery of EPP modules comes several new amazingly useful creations that will provide incredible benefits. In addition to improving your already considerably impressive designs, you can even ward off Erchius Ghosts, insanity, sheer darkness or the need to eat!"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/musicplayers/0",
    "value": "Music"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/musicplayers/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou can now create a variety of music boxes at your Tinkering Table. These can play any music from Starbound, Frackin' Universe or the add-on Frackin' Music, if you have it installed."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mining1/0",
    "value": "Improved Mining"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mining1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've gained the ability to make a variety of more useful mining tools. Of particular note is the Mining Laser, which can be upgraded with Manipulator Modules and uses your energy instead of durability. With enough upgrades, they get quite fast, and are a worthy investment."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mining2/0",
    "value": "Power Mining"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mining2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nThey may not last forever, but they sure do mine fast. You gain access to a few more consumable mining tools."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/gadgets1/0",
    "value": "Gadgetry"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/gadgets1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've developed a number of useful tools. Their functionality can be improved by upgrading them with manipulator modules."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/gadgets2/0",
    "value": "Advanced Gadgets"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/gadgets2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYour experimentation has led to the creation of a few cool new toys."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/gadgets3/0",
    "value": "Gadgeteering Mastery"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/gadgets3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYour desire for progress has led you to experiment with Morphite to plan a brand-new, super-awesome Matter Manipulator, as well as a few other creations on the side."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/manipulator1/0",
    "value": "Quantum Manipulation"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/manipulator1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nTurns out you could do better than just Morphite. With a Quantum Manipulator, you can rewrite the fabric of reality itself to excavate vast amounts of material in record time. The Protectorate would be quite jealous, if it still existed."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/experimentweapons/0",
    "value": "Experimental Weapons"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/experimentweapons/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nYou've just got so many ideas floating around in your head that there's nothing else to do but put them all onto paper. You can now upgrade several pre-existing weapons into bizarre and lethal new forms."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/spacebasic/0",
    "value": "Spacefaring and Vehicles"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/spacebasic/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYour spaceship may have broken down, but that doesn't mean you can't fix it. Using parts from your old junked FTL drive and the thermal power of Core Fragments, you are now able to make a basic ship engine (^cyan;STL Engine^reset;, created at a ^orange;Machining Table^reset;).\n\nWhile fine for intrastellar travel, the STL engine isn't nearly powerful enough to leave your system - you'll need to ^orange;Research^reset; proper FTL technology to do that.\n\nIf ^cyan;Fuel^reset; is proving an issue to find for your ship: head to a ^green;Moon^reset; or produce some ^cyan;Hydrogen^reset; by processing water (via ^orange;Extraction^reset; or ^orange;Centrifuge^reset;).\n\nAdditionally, you can craft a very simple mech for EVA or planetary usage (created at a ^orange;Mech Part Crafting Table^reset;. You can ^green;Research^reset; one later, or use the one at the ^orange;Outpost^reset;).\n\nMechs will provide a large amount of damage resistance and help you stay alive for longer in harsh situations, and are able to ^green;Fly^reset; in an atmosphere as well as space.\n\nIf you're having trouble finding ^orange;Core Fragments^reset;, just dig towards the planet core. You'll find some there."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/spaceftl1/0",
    "value": "Faster than Light"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/spaceftl1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nThe science behind Erchius Crystals is still very vague, but one thing is known for certain: these crystals hold the key to FTL travel. With the ability to make your own FTL drives, the whole galaxy is now open to exploration.\n\nWhen Erchius-based drives were still in their infancy, only Erchius fuel could power FTL travel. However, it has since been discovered how to fuel drives with a variety of sources such as ^green;radioactive isotopes^reset; or ^green;biofuel^reset;."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/shipcrafting/0",
    "value": "Shipcrafting"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/shipcrafting/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've designed a Ship Crafting Table to produce more advanced ship components."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/shipdecorative/0",
    "value": "Ship Decoration"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/shipdecorative/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou gain access to a large number of decorative ship objects. They don't do anything, but maybe they'll make your ship look cooler?"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbasic/0",
    "value": "Mech Creation"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbasic/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've learned a lot about building modular mechs and can now make galactic-standard mech parts at a ^orange;Mech Crafting Table^reset;.\n\nThe weight of your mech is very important. Lighter mechs get around more easily and burn less fuel, while heavy mechs are more durable and can crush things by jumping on them.\n\n^yellow;Note:^reset; You no longer need to gather \"salvage\" components to make mechs - they are now made with other resources such as circuit boards and energy cores. Salvage can be ^orange;extracted^reset; to provide potentially useful resources instead."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbody1/0",
    "value": "Improved Mech Bodies"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbody1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nWith increased crafting skill comes the ability to make more advanced mech bodies that resist damage and store more fuel and survive in dangerous atmospheres more easily."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbody2/0",
    "value": "Advanced Mech Bodies"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbody2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou can now make even stronger mech bodies using more complex materials."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbody3/0",
    "value": "Superior Mech Bodies"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbody3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nThe strongest mech bodies around are now within your ability thanks to your mech-building talent."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmobility1/0",
    "value": "Improved Mech Mobility"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmobility1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've improved on the movement systems of your mech and can now craft faster legs and boosters."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmobility2/0",
    "value": "Advanced Mech Mobility"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmobility2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nIt's not enough to just go fast - you've got to go really, really fast. You're one step closer to that goal with your newly improved designs."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmobility3/0",
    "value": "Superior Mech Mobility"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmobility3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYour talent has produced some of the highest-end mech parts around, letting you run, jump and fly your mech through the stars at record pace."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsweapons1/0",
    "value": "Improved Mech Weapons"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsweapons1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've learned to make some stronger weaponry for your mechs."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsweapons2/0",
    "value": "Advanced Mech Weapons"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsweapons2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nThe universe can be a dangerous place, but not if you've got a really big gun. You can make even better mech weapons."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsweapons3/0",
    "value": "Superior Mech Weapons"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsweapons3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nThe way you see it, there's no reason to own a mech if you can't strap a BFG to it and go to town on someone (or something) that deserves it. Your newest death-dealing mech weapons are perfect for doing just that."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmodules1/0",
    "value": "Improved Mech Modules"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmodules1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou can now craft better modules for your mech which grant better stats or increased utility."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmodules2/0",
    "value": "Advanced Mech Modules"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmodules2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou are able to craft even better mech modules."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmodules3/0",
    "value": "Superior Mech Modules"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmodules3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYou can make incredibly powerful mech modules."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbest/0",
    "value": "Peerless Mech Crafting"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbest/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nYou know everything there is to know about modular mechs. You can make extremely amazing mech parts that blow the competition away, and summon your mech to you in the field."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/spaceftl2/0",
    "value": "Improved FTL Tech"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/spaceftl2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've improved on your FTL design, allowing for the creation of bigger, more powerful engines and a way to further purify and enhance your ship's fuel."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/spaceftl3/0",
    "value": "Advanced FTL Tech"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/spaceftl3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou've studied erchius crystals extensively and know a great deal about their functionality. You can build even better FTL drives and fuel purifiers."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/spaceftl4/0",
    "value": "Peerless FTL Tech"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/spaceftl4/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYour knowledge of FTL tech is mind-boggling to anyone but you. You can make the fastest FTL drives and boosters around, and can purify and enhance FTL fuel so efficiently that you can cross the distance between stars with only a few drops of fuel."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/sciencestuff/0",
    "value": "Lab Utilities"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/sciencestuff/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou can now create a variety of helpful objects at your Machining Table, though you may have to upgrade it first to do so."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/vehicles1/0",
    "value": "Vehicle Creation"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/vehicles1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nTurns out making cool vehicles isn't too different from working with spaceships. You can make submarines and VTOL craft that can operate both in space and in atmosphere. Make them at your Auto Assembler/Matter Assembler."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/vehicles2/0",
    "value": "Supreme Vehicles"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/vehicles2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nYou've designed a couple more vehicles that are deadlier, faster, more durable and all around, super useful."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/batteries/0",
    "value": "Compact Power"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/batteries/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've learned to make space-efficient batteries at an ^orange;Atomic Furnace^reset; which will be useful as surplus power sources in machinery and some weapons."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/techs1/0",
    "value": "Homemade Techs"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/techs1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've learned to make your own body-enhancing Techs and can create a few basic ones in your ^orange;Personal Tricorder^reset;."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/techs2/0",
    "value": "Improved Techs"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/techs2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou can make improved Techs that provide greater utility and function. They are accessed via your ^orange;Personal Tricorder^reset;."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/techs3/0",
    "value": "Superior Techs"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/techs3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou can make significantly improved Techs that provide even more benefit. They are accessed via your ^orange;Personal Tricorder^reset;."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/techs4/0",
    "value": "Peerless Techs"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/strings/research/techs4/1",
    "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYou're one of the best tech engineers in the whole galaxy, and your creations are the envy of just about everyone in the field. You can make extremely powerful techs. They are accessed via your ^orange;Personal Tricorder^reset;."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/trees/fu_engineering",
    "value": "Mühendislik"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/default/0",
    "value": "Kullanım Rehberi"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/default/1",
    "value": "Bir araştırma seçmek için ızgaradaki simgelerden birine tıkla.\nSol fare tuşunu basılı tutup sürükleyerek ağaçta gezinebilirsin.\n\n- Ekranın üst kısmındaki en soldaki düğme, seçebileceğin araştırma ağaçlarını listeler.\n\n- İkinci düğme, gizli olmayan araştırmaları listeler. Listedeki bir araştırmaya tıklarsan görünüm ona odaklanır. Listeyi kapatmak için tekrar tıkla.\n\n- Üçüncü düğme, görünümü ağacın ortasına veya seçili araştırmaya odaklar.\n\n- Son düğme ^orange;düşük kalite modunu^reset; açıp kapatır. Bu modda arayüz hedefe kaymak yerine doğrudan geçer. Ana ekranda sürükleme sırasında görünüm, fare tuşunu bıraktıktan sonra güncellenir. Bu mod açıkken arama listesini kullanmak daha pratiktir."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/0",
    "value": "Temel Eğitim"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 1^reset;\n\nProtectorate Akademisi’nde aldığın dört yıllık eğitim, bir kaza sonrasında uzun süre hayatta kalmanı sağlayacak temel becerileri kazandırdı."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/engineering/0",
    "value": "İmalat"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/engineering/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 1^reset;\n\n^orange;İmalat Tezgâhı^reset; mekanik bileşenler üretmenin ana merkezidir ve bilimsel çalışmalarının çoğunda temel çalışma tezgâhı olarak kullanılır. Artık bu tezgâhı ve mühendislikte kullanılan çeşitli temel eşyaları kendin üretebilirsin.\n\nBir ^orange;İmalat Tezgâhı^reset; üretmek için temel ^green;[C] Üretim^reset; menünü kullanmalısın."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/goldcircuitry/0",
    "value": "Altın Devreler"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/goldcircuitry/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 2^reset;\n\nAltının bilgisayar teknolojisinde birçok yararlı kullanımı vardır. Artık onu işlemci ve RAM modülü üretiminde kullanabilirsin. Önce İmalat Tezgâhını ^orange;Otomatik Birleştiriciye^reset; yükseltmeyi unutma!"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/shields/0",
    "value": "Kalkanlar"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/shields/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 3^reset;\n\nBilgisayar teknolojisi ve fizik konusundaki sağlam bilgin sayesinde artık ^green;üssünü hasardan koruyan^reset;, ^green;yerçekimini kontrol eden^reset; ve ^green;solunabilir hava sağlayan^reset; Kuvvet Alanları oluşturabilirsin. Oldukça kullanışlı!\n\nBir alanı korumak için bölgenin çevresindeki karenin karşılıklı köşelerine iki alan işaretleyicisi yerleştir ve bunları alan jeneratörünün çıkış bağlantısına kabloyla bağla. Alan genişleticiler röle görevi görerek işaretleyicileri normal kablo menzilinin ötesine bağlamanı sağlar."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/graphenecircuitry/0",
    "value": "Grafen Devreleri"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/graphenecircuitry/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 2^reset;\n\nGrafen, karbon kökeninin düşündüreceğinden çok daha iyi elektrik iletir. Onunla ağır makinelerde kullanılabilecek son derece dayanıklı ve ısıya dirençli devreler üretebilirsin."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/modulecrafting/0",
    "value": "Yükseltme Üretimi"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/modulecrafting/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 3^reset;\n\nMikromühendislik bilgini kullanarak artık Otomatik Birleştiricide kendi yükseltme modüllerini, manipülatör modüllerini ve Tech kartlarını üretebilirsin."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/protocitecircuitry/0",
    "value": "Protocite Devreleri"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/protocitecircuitry/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 3^reset;\n\nProtocite'ın olağanüstü enerji aktarım özelliklerini, kuantum bitleriyle çalışan son derece karmaşık işlemcilerde kullanmayı başardın. Artık yalnızca 1 veya 0 değil, bazen ikisi birden! Kuantum İşlemcilerin ileri seviye elektroniklerde birçok kullanım alanı vardır."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/focusingarray/0",
    "value": "Odaklama Dizileri"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/focusingarray/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 4^reset;\n\nKuantum bilişimi özel kristallerle birleştirerek enerji akışını odaklayan cihazlar üretebilirsin. Bunlar ileri teknoloji makinelerde ve güçlü enerji silahlarında son derece kullanışlıdır."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/microformer/0",
    "value": "Gezegen Biçimlendirme"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/microformer/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 5^reset;\n\nAntik Özü sağlam parçacık odaklayıcılarla birleştirerek mikro biçimlendirme cihazlarıyla bir gezegenin küçük bir bölümünü istediğin koşullara uyarlayabilirsin."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/terraformer/0",
    "value": "Gezegen Biçimlendirme II"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/terraformer/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 5^reset;\n\nArtık tüm gezegenleri istediğin biçime sokabilir ve çevrelerini farklı türlere dönüştürebilirsin. Bunun Okyanus dünyalarında çalışmadığını unutma; bu yüzden onlar için biçimlendirici bulunmaz."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/terraformer2/0",
    "value": "Gezegen Biçimlendirme III"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/terraformer2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 6^reset;\n\nGezegen biçimlendirme cihazları konusundaki bilgin sayesinde artık çok daha ilginç dünya türleri oluşturabilirsin."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/morphitecircuitry/0",
    "value": "Morphite Devreleri"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/morphitecircuitry/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 5^reset;\n\nMorphite sayesinde yapay zekâ teknolojisi bile erişebileceğin bir alan hâline geldi. Kendini geliştirebilen ve temel kararlar verebilen son derece hızlı bilgi işlem bileşenleri üretebilirsin. Pek çok hükûmetin, yapabileceklerinden korktuğu için bu teknolojiyi tamamen yasaklaması şaşırtıcı değil."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/powercores1/0",
    "value": "Enerji Çekirdekleri"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/powercores1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 3^reset;\n\nHer birinin uzun bir bilimsel ve askerî kullanım listesi olan üç güçlü enerji çekirdeği tasarladın. Erimiş Çekirdekler yüksek fırınlar veya lav püskürten alev silahları gibi aşırı ısıyla çalışan sistemlerde mükemmeldir. Güç Çekirdekleri kinetik uygulamalarda öne çıkar; çok sayıda hareketli parçaya sahip makinelerde ve ileri seviye balistik silahlarda kullanışlıdır. Nükleer Çekirdekler ise fisyon reaktörlerinde radyasyonu yönlendirmek veya yüksek enerji isteyen icatlar için devasa miktarda enerji üretmekte kullanılır."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/powercores2/0",
    "value": "Geliştirilmiş Çekirdekler"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/powercores2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 4^reset;\n\nKompakt güç kaynaklarındaki ustalığın iki yeni kullanışlı çekirdek üretmeni sağladı ve mühendislik olanaklarını ciddi biçimde genişletti. Işınlayıcı Çekirdekleri ulaşım ve büyük otomatik eşya ağları kurmak için idealdir. Parçacık Çekirdekleri ise güçlü bir lazerdeki fotonlar gibi atomik ve atomaltı parçacıkları yönlendirmede rakipsizdir."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/teleporters/0",
    "value": "Kişisel Işınlayıcılar"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/teleporters/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 4^reset;\n\nArtık bir uzmana para vermene gerek yok; o uzman ^green;sensin^reset;! Kendi başına çeşitli kişisel ışınlayıcılar üretebilirsin."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers1/0",
    "value": "Araştırma Bilgisayarları"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 2^reset;\n\nBilgisayar bileşenleri konusundaki bilgini, eşyaları senin için otomatik olarak araştıran kullanışlı dizüstü bilgisayarlar üretmekte kullandın."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers2/0",
    "value": "Geliştirilmiş Araştırma Bilgisayarları"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 3^reset;\n\nKuantum bilişime erişimin sayesinde daha hızlı araştırma yapan ve daha fazla veri depolayan güçlü bilgisayarlar üretebilirsin."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers3/0",
    "value": "Sinir Ağları"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 4^reset;\n\nYapay zekâ teknolojisiyle, önceki tüm bilgisayarları açık ara geride bırakarak senin için devasa miktarda Araştırma üreten bir veri kulesi tasarladın."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers4/0",
    "value": "Üstün Ağlar"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers4/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 5^reset;\n\nYapay zekân artık son derece gelişmiş ve senin için devasa miktarda Araştırma üretebiliyor. Böylece ayaklarını uzatıp işi sonunda güvenebileceğin bir sisteme bırakabilirsin."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction1/0",
    "value": "Kaynak Çıkarma Temelleri"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 1^reset;\n\nKaynak çıkarmanın temellerini öğrendin ve artık malzemeleri çıkarmak, araştırmak ve santrifüjlemek için basit cihazlar üretebilirsin.\n\n^cyan;Çıkarıcı^reset;\n\nİçine neredeyse her şeyi koyabilirsin; onu başka bir şeye dönüştürür. Çoğu eşya 50'li gruplar hâlinde işlenir.\n\n^cyan;Santrifüj^reset;\n\nİçine herhangi bir sıvı koyduğunda çalışmaya başlar. Ancak ahşap olanı lav ve diğer uçucu maddelere dayanacak kadar sağlam değildir. ^orange;Güç Sistemleri^reset; ağacından araştırılır.\n\n^cyan;Araştırma Bilgisayarı^reset;\n\nDeğeri 0'dan büyük bir eşya koyduğunda, onu eşyanın piksel değerinin ^green;%5'i^reset; kadar Araştırmaya otomatik olarak dönüştürür. Daha hızlı bilgisayarları ^orange;Altın Devreler^reset; araştırmasında ilerleyerek üretebilirsin."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction2/0",
    "value": "Çıkarma Laboratuvarları"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 2^reset;\n\nÇıkarma Laboratuvarı, El Değirmenine göre büyük bir sıçramadır ve çok daha hızlı çalışır. Her türden kaynağı işlemek için birden fazla Çıkarma Laboratuvarı kurmak isteyeceksin."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction3/0",
    "value": "Gelişmiş Çıkarma"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 3^reset;\n\nÇıkarma Laboratuvarı tasarımını ciddi biçimde geliştirdin. Yeni sürüm kaynakları her zamankinden hızlı işler ve hatta ek çıktılar sağlayabilir."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics1/0",
    "value": "Temel Robotik"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 2^reset;\n\nMühendislik bilginle sana yardımcı olacak birkaç temel konuşlandırılabilir robot yardımcısı tasarladın."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics2/0",
    "value": "Güçlendirilmiş Robotlar"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics2/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 3^reset;\n\nRobotik bilgin gelişiyor ve yeni tasarımlarında bunun etkisi açıkça görülüyor. Artık daha güçlü robotlara erişebilirsin."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics3/0",
    "value": "Katil Robotlar"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics3/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 4^reset;\n\nSavaş dronları üretmede ustalaştın. Son tasarımların her zamankinden daha ölümcül ve seni gayet iyi koruyacak."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/tinkering1/0",
    "value": "İnce İşçilik"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/tinkering1/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 1^reset;\n\nMühendisliğin yalnızca yeni şeyler üretmekten değil, elindekileri geliştirmekten de ibaret olduğunu öğreniyorsun. Bu amaçla EPP modülleri, madencilik ekipmanları, özel silah yükseltmeleri ve Kanca Atıcı ya da Madencilik Lazeri gibi kullanışlı araçlar üretmeni sağlayan bir ^orange;İnce İşçilik Tezgâhı^reset; yapmayı öğrendin."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmbasic/0",
    "value": "Temel EPP Modülleri"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmbasic/1",
    "value": "^orange;Kademe 2^reset;\n\nEPP'nin zaten sağladığı etkilere ek yararlar kazandırmak için takılabilen bir dizi basit EPP modülü geliştirdin."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmadv/0",
    "value": "Geliştirilmiş Modüller"
